      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process**, immediately before that process starts. \n\nSpecifically, the page describes that:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected **only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process** \u2014 not into the Hub\u0027s own process environment\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated with the credential\n- The same pattern applies to the Query agent as well \u2014 it receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn time\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting environment variables, since the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually needs it.",
